npc sick-2 14.6 24.8 cast=refugee-2 facing=up
npc sick-3 20.2 22 cast=refugee-3 facing=left

; The rest of them.
npc refugee-a 17.4 12.4 look=513 name="A Refugee" facing=left say="Three weeks walking. My boots gave up in the first.|They burned the mill at Ashford. Then the houses.|The bread's gone by noon. Every day."
npc refugee-b 19.8 12.2 look=527 name="A Doomward Farmer" facing=down say="We had a farm. Forty acres. Now I've a blanket.|The Watch won't look at us. Like we're weather.|Ash on everything, back home. Even the snow."
npc refugee-c 5.6 19.8 look=539 name="An Old Woman" facing=right say="I was born in Doomward. I'll not die in a field.|Sit, love. There's no chairs, but sit.|My grandson's still back there. Somewhere."
npc refugee-d 8 24.2 look=552 name="A Child" wander=2 say="Are you a soldier? You don't look like a soldier.|Mum says the city's made of gold inside.|I'm not hungry. I'm just saying I'm not."
npc refugee-e 10.4 26.6 look=561 name="A Cook" facing=left say="Turnip stew. It was turnip stew yesterday too.|There's always enough for one more spoon.|Don't ask what's in it. I didn't."
npc refugee-f 4.6 13.8 look=574 name="A Refugee" facing=right say="They've let the merchants through all morning.|A wall that big, and no room behind it.|I carried that girl forty miles. Now we wait."
npc refugee-g 21.2 24.2 look=588 name="A Refugee" facing=up say="Mira's been at it since dawn. She'll drop before she stops.|My brother's on that cot. He's better than he was.|Thank you for coming out. Nobody comes out."
npc refugee-h 16.2 15.4 look=595 name="A Boy" wander=2 say="Is that a real sword?|We saw grey men on the road. They didn't talk.|Mum says don't go near the trees."

